      "section": "论征太岁",
      "text": "渊海子平卷三",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c174:p0001",
      "sha256": "afeacdbf71d62ad7e9312d541ed7283fc2913c2bfb438bd0e473b11c14c1a68c"
    },
    {
      "section": "论征太岁",
      "text": "论征太岁",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c174:p0002",
      "sha256": "888f9512096358ea54590fee49f4a198e582b51dddceb1980b114afb151d91e3"
    },
    {
      "section": "论征太岁",
      "text": "征者，战也。如臣触其君，乃下犯上之意。日干支冲克太岁曰征，运干支伤冲太岁亦曰征，太岁干支冲日干支者亦曰征。但看八字有无救助，仔细推详，百发百中。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c174:p0003",
      "sha256": "349a2404b1ff1d864f2e86a7496eb296be59213fcbcb905a39560817e4c934f4"
    },
    {
      "section": "论征太岁",
      "text": "日干支合太岁干支，曰晦，大运会岁干者亦然。遇此主晦气一年，反复，欲速不达。假如",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c174:p0004",
      "sha256": "3c6e80e909529aedb18812ea25fef52692fcdfa6c79e3a9e67368a6d036172ea"
    },
    {
      "section": "论征太岁",
      "text": "乙丑 乙亥 壬申 乙巳，运行辛未，丙寅年，日子之壬克太岁之丙，日支申庚克太岁之寅甲，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c174:p0005",
      "sha256": "6c3681827f996f9f0b9ceeffd7af4336b9a4f0ab2cb31e34a055cb5a5dc63625"
    },
    {
      "section": "论征太岁",
      "text": "又且寅刑巳、巳刑申、申刑寅，行辛未运会太岁木局之伤官，皆为不吉。其年甲午月火旺，战克己土，乙木生所为战，故死於非命矣。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c174:p0006",
      "sha256": "31ef046a8aa405b9a8bab1c09b1f72e4a6e4c524f2dfbdca1f2b5903f785b969"
    },
    {
      "section": "论征太岁",
      "text": "眉批：征者如两君相持不能比和，谓之年征。得胜者吉，不得胜者凶，此只以一年之事断之。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 41,
          "layer": "historical_commentary",
          "marker": "眉批：",
          "boundary_closed": true
        }
      ],
      "layer_status": "explicit_marker_not_collated",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c174:p0007",
      "sha256": "57a51ced836ecd3adee93d91cc966e0496344ef69c7e99802134da86631c9c7b"
    },
    {
      "section": "论征太岁",
      "text": "经曰：“太岁乃衆煞之主，人命遇之未必为灾。若遇战斗之乡，必主刑於本命。”",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c174:p0008",
      "sha256": "e8ee859c379f68d26e352939162d3d1b013c44210296ec475bb9eec1cb58d429"
    }
  ]
}
